      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 80,
      "text": "1. QUANTUM PROBABILISTIC STATE\n• Chromosome Q = [q₁, q₂, ..., q_m]\n• Q-Bit: |q_i⟩ = cos(θ_i)|0⟩ + sin(θ_i)|1⟩\n• Continuous State Angles: θ_i ∈ [0, π/2]\n• Simultaneous Exploration of Combinatorial\n  Space (Vessel × Route × Speed × Fuel)\n• Quantum Observation Collapse:\n  x_i = 1 if U(0,1) < sin²(θ_i) else 0",
