      "x": 980,
      "y": 80,
      "text": "3. QUANTUM ROTATION GATE UPDATES\n• Non-Dominated Sorting & Crowding Distance\n• Pareto Dominance Matrix between Q-bits\n• Unitary Quantum Gate Matrix U(Δθ):\n  [cos(Δθ)  -sin(Δθ)]\n  [sin(Δθ)   cos(Δθ)]\n• Dynamic Step-size Rotation Strategy:\n  Δθ_i = sign(S_best - x_i) × f(rank, hv)\n• Avoids Premature Convergence vs Classical GA",
